## Quick “wrong assumption” list

| Assumption | Reality |
|---|---|
| Roles `student_free` / `student_premium` | DB role is `student` + `app_sub_tier` |
| Robokassa / Supabase Edge for pay | YooKassa `deploy/pay-api` |
| Vercel / GitHub Pages is production | Timeweb VPS static `out/` + Caddy |
| `app/api` ships to prod | Stashed at export; Caddy proxies `/api` |
| Replicate is the AI backend | Hugging Face / Gradio / Groq songwriter |
| Guest is a DB role | Guest = logged out |
| Client may `update` lesson balance | RPC / pay-api / admin only |
